EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}That game of hide-and-seek?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Oh, I stopped playing AGES ago,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Şu saklambaç oyunu mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ah, onu ÇAĞLAR önce bıraktım,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I mean, we couldn't hide forever.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
You should have found all of us,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}No podíamos jugar eternamente.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Además, tampoco pudiste encontrar
a todo el mundo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Non pensavo che i nostri nascondigli{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
fossero così difficili da trovare,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Yani, sonsuza kadar saklanamazdık.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Hepimizi bulman gerekirdi,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Maybe we hid too well,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but we just
couldn't wait for you forever,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Ya te vale! ¿Cómo pudiste irte sin
haber encontrado a todo el mundo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡No vuelvas a hacerlo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Next time we play, I guess we'll
have to find easier hiding spots.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
or you'll have to look harder!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}La prossima volta sceglieremo
nascondigli un po' più facili.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}e tu dovrai cercare meglio!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bir dahaki sefer daha kolay saklanma
yerleri bulmamız gerekecek galiba{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ya da sen daha dikkatli arayacaksın!
